OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'urgent' safety review
OL,4,Aafter A38 death
OL,5,
OL,6,FBromsgrove's MP is calling for an
OL,7,Furgent safety probe into a #50m
OL,8,Froadwork scheme after a cyclist was
OL,9,Fkilled.
OL,11,FBradley Thomas wants Worcestershire
OL,12,FCounty Council to carry out a review
OL,13,Finto the A38 Bromsgrove Route
OL,14,FEnhancement Programme (BREP).
OL,16,FOn Tuesday, a man in his 80s died in a
OL,17,Fcollision between a lorry and a bicycle
OL,18,Fon the northbound side of the A38.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
